(text "C3 | CLEAR-ON-FAULT, FRESH-EDGE ARM LATCH" (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6d9e01cf-647b-54eb-829e-3df535dec7a8"))
(text "CLEAR_AND = SESSION AND RAILS_OK. ARM_BUFFER conditions ARM_REQ; it must NOT be gated by READY." (at 15.24 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "ced9874d-f893-5807-bd32-a289a91921bc"))
(text "READY = CLR_N; ARMED = BUS_OE. Firmware integration is pending: current sketch does not operate this handshake." (at 15.24 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "84ae578c-eb0c-53f8-8581-ec03f9573588"))
(text "Park all seven forward outputs low; obtain READY and a new ARM edge; only then begin clock/VCAP/reset qualification." (at 15.24 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "ec25d7ed-9bef-57ea-9d08-e70f768a9d3a"))
(text "Any fault invalidates the session. Settled Boolean behavior is not power-on-Q, analog ramp, glitch or mechanical STOP qualification." (at 15.24 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "29f13229-309e-55f1-9c39-3eef87f0d97e"))
